      "message": "**Redundant Pointer Check** In `util/elan/iapcontrol.cc` inside `openDevice`:\n\n```c\nconst struct libusb_interface_descriptor *alt \u003d \u0026inter-\u003ealtsetting[j];\nif (alt \u003d\u003d nullptr || alt-\u003ebInterfaceClass !\u003d LIBUSB_CLASS_HID) {\n```\n\n`alt` is assigned the address of an array element. It is impossible for it to be `nullptr`.\n\n* **Recommendation:** Remove the `alt \u003d\u003d nullptr` check to reduce clutter.",
